{"created": "2025-05-27T12:22:58.559774+00:00", "modified": "2025-05-27T12:23:00.984172+00:00", "id": 15422339, "conceptrecid": "15422338", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15422339", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.15422338", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15422339", "metadata": {"title": "EIS data of 54 21700 cells", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15422339", "publication_date": "2025-05-26", "description": "<h1>Scope</h1>\n<p>This dataset contains electrochemical impedance spectroscopy (EIS) data collected from a batch of 21700 cylindrical NMC811 lithium-ion cells at a state of charge (SoC) of 30%. The measurement was performed using a Keysight SL1007A Scienlab Battery Test System in galvanostatic mode.</p>\n<h1>Data</h1>\n<p>Each CSV file (IDXX.csv) contains the results of the EIS test performed on the battery cell with the corresponding indentifier IDXX (where XX spans 01 - 54).&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>RDF Metadata</h1>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.025%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 25.045%;\"><col style=\"width: 25.045%;\"><col style=\"width: 25.045%;\"><col style=\"width: 24.856%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Filename</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Description</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Format</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Usage</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15422339/files/keysight_eis_csvw_schema_0.1.0.json\">keysight_eis_csvw_schema_0.1.0.json</a></td>\n<td>Metadata describing the table schema of the tabular data using terms from the CSVW, DCAT, and BattINFO resources.&nbsp;</td>\n<td>JSON-LD</td>\n<td>Enables agents to understand the structure and meaning of the tabular data in the CSV files.&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15422339/files/metadata.jsonld\">metadata.jsonld</a></td>\n<td>Metadata describing the tests, cells, and results contained in this record.&nbsp;</td>\n<td>JSON-LD</td>\n<td>Enables integration into semantic web and FAIR data workflows.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15422339/files/metadata.html\">metadata.html</a></td>\n<td>HTML page that embeds the JSON-LD metadata for machine agents</td>\n<td>&nbsp;HTML</td>\n<td>Helps web crawlers to find and process the metadata</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Moertelmaier, Manuel", "affiliation": "Keysight Technologies (Austria)", "orcid": "0000-0003-4239-9809"}, {"name": "Kasper, Manuel", "affiliation": "Keysight Technologies (Austria)", "orcid": "0000-0002-6143-2881"}, {"name": "Clark, Simon", "affiliation": "SINTEF", "orcid": "0000-0002-8758-6109"}], "version": "1.0.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "communities": [{"id": "101135486"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "15422338"}}]}}, "title": "EIS data of 54 21700 cells", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/15422339", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/15422339", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/15422339?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15422339", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15422339", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.15422339", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/15422339/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/15422338", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/15422338", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15422338", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.15422338", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:15422339/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:15422339/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/15422339/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/15422339/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/15422339/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zen